  // alphaToCoverage leaves the card's square panel drawn solid (the phones' "flat smeared leaves")
  // (leaf cards and crowns fade from 2.6 m in: a follow camera near a crown sees through it)
  const LEAF_FADE = [0.9, 2.6];
